{"title":"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive numbers for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5ade6f004b308cf4a146815e3b30a44ec4a97c6a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\operatorname{log}_{9}(p) = \\operatorname{log}_{12}(q) = \\operatorname{log}_{16}(p+q).\\]\" width=\"258\" height=\"18\" /> What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14bb62fe5648e3bd1d232894b298dded2bdab3d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{q}{p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"11\" height=\"36\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc910107b1c6edd147a58a2b2dddf68f35843a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{4}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1+\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{8}{5}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{16}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"469\" height=\"41\" /> \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rewrite the equation as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/5/3859f1640f720099ddc6f5d3dfe97be75ec6af4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log{p}}{\\log{9}} = \\frac{\\log{q}}{\\log{12}} = \\frac{\\log{(p + q)}}{\\log{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"220\" height=\"42\" />. Then, the system can be split into 3 pairs: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd785fa316972fc63c38318f99a2f21d987ef9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log{p}}{\\log{9}} = \\frac{\\log{q}}{\\log{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"111\" height=\"41\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/1253bf0f40370257d19b3319aae15c224c4010d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log{q}}{\\log{12}} = \\frac{\\log{(p + q)}}{\\log{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"156\" height=\"42\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36ebb7674f5446af99baef26518d34591b6d9a9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log{p}}{\\log{9}} = \\frac{\\log{(p + q)}}{\\log{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"147\" height=\"42\" />. Cross-multiplying in the first two, we obtain: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d68fdccdde58bd44ca734fc8bb563e4204b058.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log{12})(\\log{p}) = (2\\log{3})(\\log{q})\\]\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fa4de9df972754f9290d1a908e61ef01c942d54.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log{12})(\\log{(p + q)}) = (2\\log{4})(\\log{q})\\]\" width=\"286\" height=\"18\" />\nAdding these equations results in: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/befe925e52672f5c6321f6dbb74534f3b94e7f68.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log{12})(\\log{p(p+q)}) = (2\\log{12})(\\log{q})\\]\" width=\"304\" height=\"18\" /> which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/5/585e217228a272b5f344d72599861f9dc9cebd2f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p(p + q) = q^2\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"19\" /> Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79ccffd0d1686be982eed9fdcb75f35551e8cb3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" /> on both sides gives: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f2a923df7c1f7e55811be66e09997b705ec0dd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p+q}{q} = \\frac{q}{p} = \\frac{p}{q} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"149\" height=\"39\" />. We set the desired value, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/0/5105293ee307b7d1a5f1a44ab4908382a586a235.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q/p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and substitute it into our equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/b/d7b37421ca015f68e3fc6d6f4b31a8029f9a7e43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} + 1 = x \\implies x^2 - x - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"244\" height=\"37\" /> which is solved to get our answer: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/2/6b2f2ac0c357916eea7e9ee0e06dce6960021989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D) } \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"102\" height=\"53\" />. -lucasxia01\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For some number t:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aaeb72db4568905be688615ed78eaf5c00222b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 9^{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee4512feece36415e8fef1a945d08dcd895a09bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = 12^{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/0/a70ee1fbd7780f085aad96d017bb9bb4b75e9524.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q = 16^{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Next we can divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/856ee48ce76ddbd106a05384c2ea2c28e3b76c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to obtain\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/9/be9b0865971d81114f7f8bc0be119d2d61cc4390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p+q}{p} = 1 + \\frac{q}{p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"115\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Furthermore, we know that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/9/8f902241eb51e1f87e5dcd0bd0632b47d8376233.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p+q}{p} = (\\frac{16}{9})^{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"112\" height=\"42\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/264e01475a72ed71783d53caa513048509d23d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{q}{p} = (\\frac{4}{3})^{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"72\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Substituting into the previous equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/f/76f1b82188f30c2f51f81e1808de1ab585e83d64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{16}{9})^{t} = 1 + (\\frac{4}{3})^{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a9578b15d553fff1ad69a0dd02093fbf57a5d33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = (\\frac{4}{3})^{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" /> and we can observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/2/71258d5015e1149125223d54e37de508fdf75606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{q}{p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, then similarly to solution 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff420428a2b70d3d7b313fff48d363d8d0d45432.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = 1 + x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />, in which we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/2/6b2f2ac0c357916eea7e9ee0e06dce6960021989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D) } \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{5}}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"102\" height=\"53\" /> - ehmmaq\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME\" title=\"1988 AHSME\">1988 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016230638\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 231/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6442/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.510      1 -total\n 59.50%    8.633      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 39.04%    5.664      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13687:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016230638 and revision id 196487. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}